\">Sally</span>: Hey Peter. Would you mind if we sit inside instead?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Of course not.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Personally, I think it was nicer outside.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure but I would like to point out that it isn't windy in here.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le16ob09re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Mhm. Anyways, how's the job? You went to that meet and greet today right?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'd say that it was a successful day. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Good to hear.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Sorry to interrupt, I'm Craig. I'll be your waiter today. Could I start you off with anything to drink?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I would like some lemonade please.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Water is fine for me, thanks.", "id": 2, "time": "21000", "image": "engenn5le16ob09re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Could I get you some appetizers as well?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes. Can I get the French onion soup please?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Certainly. And for you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I want something light. I was wondering if you could give me some suggestions.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Sure, you can try our new quinoa salad or a lettuce wrap.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A lettuce wrap? I think that sounds interesting.  I'll have that. Thanks.", "id": 3, "time": "44000", "image": "engenn5le16ob09re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le16ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le16ob09re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}